message: >-
  If you use lexinspect in research, please cite it as below, and also cite the
  word lists and formulas you report on (see src/lexinspect/data/SOURCES.md).
title: lexinspect
abstract: >-
  English text analysis: readability, lexical diversity, CEFR, BNC/COCA, NGSL
  and AWL vocabulary profiles, phrasal expressions, metadiscourse and spelling.
  CLI, HTTP API and web app.
type: software
authors:
